# Copy to /etc/amnezia-ru-split/vpn-endpoints
# Public IPv4 addresses of the VPN servers Amnezia connects to, one per line.
# amnezia-ru-split keeps a direct host route to each of them, because the Amnezia
# daemon cannot find the default gateway by itself on a big routing table.
# Add the new address when you switch to another server.
#
# 198.51.100.7   <- replace with your server (this is a documentation address)
